## CaboCha (Modified for Android - Bundled)

CaboCha -- Yet Another Japanese Dependency Parser
Copyright (c) 2001-2008, Taku Kudo
All rights reserved.

This project includes a modified version of CaboCha bundled and adapted for Android.

### Version Information
- Original submodule: https://github.com/taku910/cabocha
- Base commit: 96e100a62f6dadceb490cdd61c8c15fb561f6674
- De-submoduled on: 2026-03-06
- Status: Code ported into main repository (no longer a git submodule) 

### Modifications for Android:
- Android NDK 29 CMake build configuration
- iconv dependency replaced with stub implementation
- JNI wrapper (cabocha_jni.cpp) for Java/Kotlin integration  
- DISABLE_ICONV=1 compiler flag

